# Reel Room Light: keys (all OPTIONAL). Copy this file to .env and fill in what you have.
# Keys are read from this .env file or from your environment, nothing else. Never commit .env.

# OpenRouter: optional "fast mode".
#   On:  the fast planner plans the whole reel in about 20 s, a model picks the graphic for every beat and every hero,
#        and the number check adds a model verdict on top of the speech re-check.
#   Off: Claude Code writes the plan itself (about 1 to 2 min) and engine/validate_plan.py checks it. Everything
#        still works.
#   Get one: https://openrouter.ai/keys  (cost per reel: about $0.03 to $0.05)
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
